[chant:sabba-patti-dana-gatha]
[00:00.00]1 Handa mayaṁ sabba-patti-dāna-gāthāyo bhaṇāmase
[00:07.74]2 Puññass'idāni katassa
[00:11.29]3 Yān'aññāni katāni me
[00:15.13]4 Tesañca bhāgino hontu
[00:18.51]5 Sattānantāppamāṇakā
[00:22.15]6 Ye piyā guṇavantā ca
[00:25.67]7 Mayhaṁ mātā-pitādayo
[00:29.78]8 Diṭṭhā me cāpyadiṭṭhā vā
[00:33.41]9 Aññe majjhatta-verino
[00:36.80]10 Sattā tiṭṭhanti lokasmiṁ
[00:41.26]11 Te bhummā catu-yonikā
[00:45.12]12 Pañc'eka-catu-vokārā
[00:48.67]13 Saṁsarantā bhavābhave
[00:52.22]14 Ñātaṁ ye patti-dānam-me
[00:56.12]15 Anumodantu te sayaṁ
[00:59.24]16 Ye c'imaṁ nappajānanti
[01:02.68]17 Devā tesaṁ nivedayuṁ
[01:06.38]18 Mayā dinnāna-puññānaṁ anumodana-hetunā
[01:13.47]19 Sabbe sattā sadā hontu
[01:17.06]20 Averā sukha-jīvino
[01:20.14]21 Khemappadañca pappontu
[01:23.68]22 Tesāsā sijjhataṁ subhā
